WEBVTT

00:01:31.301 --> 00:01:34.783
Citizens were beginning
to lose faith in our promise.

00:01:35.459 --> 00:01:36.641
But you know what?

00:01:36.665 --> 00:01:39.091
I like to keep my promises.

00:01:40.165 --> 00:01:43.967
Some of my comrades and I
staged another military coup,

00:01:43.991 --> 00:01:47.606
and this time, against our own
head of state and commander.

00:01:48.292 --> 00:01:50.684
Again, it was a bloodless coup.

00:01:51.512 --> 00:01:55.130
That is how I became the new
military head of state

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:59.760
on January 16, 1996.